From: Chang Liu <cliu1004@amd.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:05:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [FlyDSL] Update BF16 paged decode to mainline for Qwen3.8 QSA
 attention

Bring aiter.ops.flydsl.pa_decode and its kernels to ROCm/aiter main: the
planned pa_decode (plan_pa_decode/PADecodePlan work plan, per-capacity
partials, max_context_length) that Qwen3.8's QSA post-gather attention calls.
buffer_ops and kernels_common stay at this tree's FlyDSL 0.3.4.1 versions.

From amd-nprotaso/aiter qwen_3_8_improvement: 696d1e24, 47d91306.
